              "IFO": [
                "The model social welfare has undergone changes both 2000 and 2005."
              ],
              "UtBak019": [
                "The model children and youth with foreign origin is new from 2000."
              ],
              "Äldreomsorg": [
                "The changes 2005 in the model care of elderly gave the municipalities with a high share of really old people a higher compensation."
              ],
              "BefForandr": [
                "Until 2004 was the model called population decrease and did only compensate municipalities with a big decreased population. From 2005 can also municipalities with a big increased population become compensated."
