              "Bebyggelsestruktur": [
                "The model municipality structrure is based on the outcome 2004 in the models water and sewerage, building costs, administration etc. and heating."
              ],
              "Strukturkostnad": [
                "The structure cost is the sum of each municipality or county councils standard cost (the  outcome in each model)"
              ],
              "Utfall": [
                "The outcome for each munisipality and county council is the difference between the own structure cost and the average structure cost in Sweden."
              ]
